{
    "id":  10330,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Linear LED Batten- Strip - 36W - BERGEN - Black - PC - CCT - 119cm",
    "reference":  "LBL36W-CCT-91237",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eLooking for a subtle yet striking way to illuminate your environment? Introducing the \u003cstrong\u003e1190mm BERGEN 36W LED Linear Strip\u003c/strong\u003e, the perfect fusion of style and functionality. Designed to create captivating environments, this strip fits anywhere from modern offices to classy residential spaces. And the\u003cstrong\u003e luminaire \u003c/strong\u003eis\u003cstrong\u003e CCT\u003c/strong\u003e: With options of \u003cstrong\u003eCool White\u003c/strong\u003e (6500K) for dazzling clarity, \u003cstrong\u003eNeutral White\u003c/strong\u003e (4200K) for balanced illumination and \u003cstrong\u003eWarm White\u003c/strong\u003e (3000K) for a cozy atmosphere, you\u0027ll always find the perfect ambiance! Save on electricity now! \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is made of high-strength polycarbonate to increase its life and resistance, finished with \u003cstrong\u003eblack\u003c/strong\u003e paint to achieve a luminaire with a stronger appearance and provide greater comfort. \u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan\u003e36W BERGEN Linear LED Strip - Black - PC - 1190mm - CCT: Selectable Color\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTransform your space with the Illuminated Elegance of the \u003cstrong\u003e36W BERGEN Linear LED Strip \u003c/strong\u003ein\u003cstrong\u003e Black\u003c/strong\u003e!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLooking for a subtle yet striking way to illuminate your surroundings? Introducing the 36W BERGEN Linear LED Strip, the perfect fusion of style and functionality. Designed to create captivating environments, this strip fits anywhere, from modern offices to elegant residential spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures that will dazzle you:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCutting-Edge Style: With a sophisticated and timeless Black finish, the BERGEN Linear LED Strip adds an elegant touch to your space, redefining how you experience lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuality Manufacturing: Constructed with high-quality \u003cstrong\u003epolycarbonate\u003c/strong\u003e (PC), this strip is robust and durable, ensuring a product that will accompany you for years. The quality of the materials isn\u0027t just visible; it\u0027s tangible!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoose Your Ideal Color: Experience the freedom to adjust the color temperature to suit your needs. The linear luminaire incorporates \u003cstrong\u003e3 options\u003c/strong\u003e of Cool White (6500K) for dazzling clarity, Neutral White (4200K) for balanced illumination and Warm White (3000K) for a cozy atmosphere, you will always find the perfect ambiance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eElegant Design: Measuring \u003cstrong\u003e1190mm x 60mm\u003c/strong\u003e, the BERGEN Linear LED Strip effortlessly adapts to any space. Whether mounted on the ceiling or the wall, its sleek and minimalist design adds a touch of sophistication to your environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConfidence in Warranty: We\u0027re confident in the quality of our strip. That\u0027s why we offer a 3-year warranty that backs your investment and your satisfaction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of the LED Linear Strip 36W - BERGEN - Black - PC - 119cm - CCT: Selectable Color\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe versatility of the 36W BERGEN Linear LED Strip in Black provides you with endless possibilities for use in a variety of environments. Some of the places where this strip can shine include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOffices and Workspaces: Create a productive and elegant work atmosphere with the adjustable lighting of the strip. Choose Cool White for maximum concentration or Warm White for a more relaxed ambiance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eModern Homes: Add a touch of sophistication to your home with the BERGEN Linear LED Strip. Use it in the kitchen, living room, hallways, or even the bathroom to enhance the beauty of each space.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShops and Stores: Highlight your products and create an inviting atmosphere for customers with the versatile lighting of the strip. Change the color according to the season or occasion for a stunning visual effect.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWaiting Rooms and Reception Areas: Surprise your visitors with lighting that reflects the professionalism and attention to detail of your business.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEntertainment Spaces: Use the strip in your home theater, game room, or bar to create the perfect ambiance according to the occasion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRestaurants and Cafés: Create a cozy atmosphere for your establishment and adjust the lighting based on the time of day for a unique dining experience.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStudy Areas: Adjustable lighting is ideal for study areas, allowing you to select the light color that best suits concentration and focus.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeauty Salons and Spas: Create a relaxing and tranquil atmosphere for your clients with the option of warm light, or switch to bright light for more detailed activities.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe\u003cstrong\u003e BERGEN 36W LED Linear Strip\u003c/strong\u003e in Black fits perfectly into a wide range of environments, allowing you to experience lighting in a whole new way. Its sleek design and versatility make it a valuable addition to any location where you want to emphasize both aesthetics and functionality.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED, we don\u0027t just sell products. We offer lighting solutions that drive the growth of your business and improve the quality of people\u0027s lives. Our passion for quality and excellence makes us your ideal partner in the world of LED lighting. Together, we light the way to a brighter future, and ensure that our products are guaranteed for QUALITY and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
